  "contract": [
    "The launch-day Normal kill video (youtube c7iqfz04PmI) gives each player 175 Runes of Ascension (375250) and",
    "two Raider's Commendations (400750) per boss. Hakkar (14834) gives six commendations, Dungeon Spoils (2021814)",
    "and 2500 runes: more than a loot row's 8-bit count holds, so boss_hakkar_coa.cpp adds them to every player who",
    "tapped him at his death, and his corpse carries no rune slot. High Priest Venoxis (14507) stands for the other",
    "bosses. Runes and commendations are currency tokens (BagFamily 8192), which the looter stores as the corpse loot",
    "opens, so their counts are read from the bags."
